SUMMARY:Classic Albums Live: Billy Joel – The Stranger
DESCRIPTION:Classic Albums Live brings Billy Joel’s The Stranger to life on stage\, note for note\, cut for cut.   Known for recreating the world’s greatest classic rock albums with precision and respect\, Classic Albums Live focuses entirely on the music\, with no costumes or impersonations.   The first half of the show features a faithful performance of The Stranger\, the landmark album that includes unforgettable songs like “Movin’ Out\,” “Just the Way You Are\,” “Only the Good Die Young\,” “She’s Always a Woman\,” and “Scenes from an Italian Restaurant.” beloved records.   Performed by an exceptional ensemble of world-class musicians\, this concert captures the sound\, spirit\, and lasting impact of one of Billy Joel’s most Experience the thrill of hearing a classic album performed live\, exactly as you remember it.
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/classic-albums-live-billy-joel-the-stranger/
LOCATION:Centre In The Square\, 101 Queen St N\, Kitchener\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Arts, Culture, Heritage & Live Performance
ORGANIZER;CN="Centre In The Square Box Office":MAILTO:BoxOffice@centreinthesquare.com
END:VEVENT
