SUMMARY:Christkindl Market
DESCRIPTION:Willkommen to the 30th anniversary of Christkindl\, celebrating three decades of holiday tradition by expanding the festivities to 10 magical days. Come for all your favourite sights\, sounds and smells of a classic European market\, and stay for the tasty treats\, live entertainment\, and warm holiday ambience.  90+ local vendors selling one-of-a-kind holiday gifts from December 3-6 and 10-13Timing varies by day – please see website for full schedule10 days of live entertainmentFamily-friendly KidsKindl zone both weekendsOutdoor food market and licensed areaMaple taffy\, blacksmith\, ice sculpture contest\, outdoor skating and moreWhether you’re visiting for a day of holiday shopping\, an evening performance\, an afternoon of family-friendly activities\, or are excited to experience everything Christkindl has in store\, there are more opportunities than ever to experience the magic of the season. Dates and times December 3 – 4 to 9 p.m.December 4 – 10 a.m. to 9 p.m.December 5 – 10 a.m. to 11 p.m.December 6 – 10 a.m. to 4 p.m.December 7 – 6 to 11 p.m.December 8 – 6 to 11 p.m.December 9 – 6 to 11 p.m.December 10 – 4 to 9 p.m.December 11 – 10 a.m. to 9 p.m.December 12 – 10 a.m. to 11 p.m.December 13 – 10 a.m. to 4 p.m.
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/christkindl-market/2026-12-03/
LOCATION:Kitchener City Hall\, 200 King Street West\, Kitchener\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Arts, Culture, Heritage & Live Performance,Attractions,Event,Family Friendly,Festivals,Food & Drink,Free Events,Holiday Events,Nightlife,Shopping
ORGANIZER;CN="City of Kitchener":MAILTO:info@kitchener.ca
END:VEVENT
