SUMMARY:SMILE (90's Rock) + Guests - STICKY & Brant Station at DALLAS Nightclub
DESCRIPTION:Experience an electrifying night of raw Rock energy and nonstop tracks that hit home for fans of every generation. Get ready for the grunge party of the year. SMILE – A Tribute to Grunge isn’t just a show — it’s a full‑scale 90s rock experience built to shake the room\, light up the stage\, and pull you straight into the era that changed music forever.With massive sound\, top‑tier musicianship\, and a killer light show fused with immersive multi‑media\, SMILE brings the raw power of the 90s roaring back to life. Every anthem. Every riff. Every moment that made grunge legendary. This is the kind of night people talk about afterward — a packed house\, a crowd singing every word\, and an energy that hits you the second you walk in. Whether you lived through the grunge era or you’re discovering it for the first time\, this show connects generations in one explosive\, unforgettable celebration of the music that defined a movement.🔥 Grab your tickets today – They will go fast. Grab your spot now and be part of a night that’s going to feel big\, loud\, and absolutely electric.Don’t wait. Don’t miss out. Reserve your tickets today and get ready for a concert‑level tribute to the soundtrack of the 90s. Special Guest:Sticky – performing the best of classic anthems from the ’80s& 2000s as a four piece who are Kitchener favoritesBrant Station – performing the best of Party Rock from the 70s\, 80s & 2000s as a five piece .. who are popular local musicians from KW !
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/smile-90s-rock-guests-sticky-brant-station-at-dallas-nightclub/
LOCATION:Dallas Night Club\, 312 King Street West\, Kitchener\, ON\, N2G 1B7\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Arts, Culture, Heritage & Live Performance,Event
END:VEVENT
