SUMMARY:Dirty Drag Bingo- Hosted by Crystal Quartz
DESCRIPTION:🎉 Dirty Drag Bingo – with Crystal Quartz 🎉🚪 Doors Open: 7:00 PM | 🎭 Show Starts: 8:00 PM🔞 19+ Event Get ready for the wildest night — Dirty Drag Bingo with Crystal Quartz! This is a high-energy\, laugh-until-you-cry kind of night packed with outrageous humor\, dazzling drag\, and nonstop entertainment. This isn’t your average bingo night… it’s louder\, bolder\, and just a little bit cheeky. Expect hilarious banter\, interactive moments\, and electrifying drag performances that keep the energy sky-high from the first number to the final call. ✨ What Makes This Night So Iconic:   Crystal Quartz is known across Ontario for hosting unforgettable\, sold-out drag bingo events that blend quick wit\, glamorous performances\, and an inclusive\, anything-goes party atmosphere. This Pride Tour edition turns it all the way up for a night you won’t forget. 🎁 Prizes: Every round features multiple chances to win\, with a mix of:• Signature Glitz & Glam prizes• Playful novelty items• Cheeky adult-themed prizes There’s something for everyone — you can always choose what you’re comfortable taking home! 💃 Expect:• Multiple rounds of bingo• Side-splitting comedy• High-energy drag performances• A vibrant\, celebratory Pride atmosphere 🍻 Bingo\, brews\, glamour\, and outrageous fun — all wrapped into one unforgettable night.📌 Important Notes:• This is a 19+ event — valid ID required• Seating is first come\, first served — please arrive early if you’d like to sit with your group• Drag is a tipping industry — if you’d like to tip\, please bring cash 💖• Please bring your own bingo dabbers or markers• Dabbers will not be available for purchase 🎟️ Seating is limited — grab your tickets early and experience the most fun you can have yelling “BINGO!”
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/dirty-drag-bingo-hosted-by-crystal-quartz/
LOCATION:Farm League Brewing\, 295 Ainslie Street South\, Cambridge\, ON\, N1R 3L3\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Event
END:VEVENT
