SUMMARY:There’s No Place Like Space - Kids Event
DESCRIPTION:There’s No Place Like Space!A little space adventure for curious little minds\, ages 6 months–6 years.Ready to explore a universe of colours\, textures\, rainbows\, and fizzy surprises?Join Smartizen for a one-hour\, space-themed adventure designed especially for babies\, toddlers\, preschoolers upto 6yo. Through sensory play\, creative crafts\, and playful science experiments\, little explorers can discover new things at their own pace while enjoying a special experience with their family.  What will your little explorer discover? Explore the Solar System and Moon Phases — Explore a space-inspired sensory world filled with colours\, textures\, and opportunities for imaginative play. Make Your Own Spaceship Cards — Create a spaceship card together and take home. The Walking Rainbow — Watch colours travel and blend in a fascinating experiment that introduces little ones to the joy of observation and discovery. Into the Fizzy Universe! — Discover bubbly\, colourful reactions in a playful introduction to science.and of course music and books about the Outer Space! A family adventure\, not just a kids’ activityAt Smartizen\, we believe childhood isn’t something to rush. Young children learn by touching\, watching\, listening\, exploring\, and trying things out. This experience gives you the chance to enjoy those little moments of discovery together.Both parents are welcome! Each session is designed for a small group of just five families\, allowing families to enjoy the activities in a more intimate setting. 🕙 Choose Your Session10:00–11:00 AM11:00 AM–12:00 PM1:00–2:00 PM2:00–3:00 PM3:00–4:00 PM4:00–5:00 PM 
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/theres-no-place-like-space-kids-event/
LOCATION:Smartizen – Early Education Academy\, 370 University Avenue East\, Waterloo\, ON\, N2K 3N2\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Event
END:VEVENT
