SUMMARY:Yuk Yuk's 50th Anniversary Spectacular
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 50 years of fearless\, unfiltered comedy when the Yuk Yuk’s 50th Anniversary Tour takes over Centre In The Square on Saturday\, November 21! Since its establishment in 1976\, Yuk Yuk’s has become the backbone of Canadian stand-up comedy. For five decades\, this homegrown institution has helped shape Canada’s distinctive comedic voice and set the standard for live\, uncensored laughs from coast to coast. More than a comedy club\, Yuk Yuk’s has launched the careers of global entertainment icons including Jim Carrey\, Norm Macdonald\, Russell Peters\, Howie Mandel\, and many more. Now\, this milestone anniversary tour celebrates that legendary legacy while showcasing a powerhouse lineup of today’s rising comedy stars. Expect an electric night of brilliant storytelling\, rapid-fire wit\, and fearless humour from some of Canada’s sharpest modern comedians. Don’t miss your chance to celebrate five decades of Canadian comedy and witness the next generation of comedy history live in Kitchener.
URL:https://explorewaterloo.ca/event/yuk-yuks-50th-anniversary-spectacular/
LOCATION:Centre in the Square\, 101 Queen Street N\, Kitchener\, ON\, N2H 6P7\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Arts, Culture, Heritage & Live Performance,Event
END:VEVENT
